decisions.story:
A todo app shows a list that refreshes in every open tab when one tab adds an item. It remembers the last filter in browser storage. The program below is the user's code. It is the same under every option. Each option then shows the few lines of battery source that invalidate the live list and read storage, because those are the lines that change.

```jet
use web

todos: fn() -> [String] { [String]{"milk"} }

home: fn() -> WebPage { web.page("Todos", todos().join(", ")) }

run: fn() {
    web.app()
        .route("/", home)
        .serve()
}
```

